matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\n- $A$ has a zero row\n- $A$ has two proportional columns\n- $A$ has two identical rows" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186329652 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fffc6699-6d6e-50bb-8cc3-7d4f0e3f1d17" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186329652 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have a zero row.\n\n- $A$ has two proportional columns:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\n- $A$ has two identical rows: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -1 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\,✓\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402861 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186402862 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402861 #edb/ref 1069 "q-43057" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402861 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402861 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & -6 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 8 & 2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}1 & \\sqrt{2} & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 8 \\\\ 0 & -\\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\sqrt{3} & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402861 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b44f28c6-ca93-5246-be2b-1a2725d36e07" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402861 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is a triangular matrix, hence \n\n$$\n|A|=3\\cdot (-6)\\cdot 2=-36\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ has proportional rows: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\sqrt{2} & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 8 \\\\ 0 & -\\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|B|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is a triangular matrix, hence \n\n$$\n|C|=(-1)\\cdot 3\\cdot 4=-12\\ne 0\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $|B|$ is equal to $0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402863 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402864 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402865 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402866 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402867 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186402863 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402862 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a4619bd4-0fd6-5b0e-85d8-4d713cc4997e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402863 #edb/ref 1080 "$|B|$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402863 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402863 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "78b84216-c188-5769-a0cf-2f3c4b5d4fe1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402864 #edb/ref 1080 "$|A|$ and $|C|$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402864 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402864 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "47a2ba38-2156-5dd9-922d-70e7a9112796" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402865 #edb/ref 1080 "$|C|$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402865 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402865 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bf232768-62b0-5a99-b6ae-c2f1d1ac4e96" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402866 #edb/ref 1080 "$|A|$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402866 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402866 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5c171a58-43ca-5ac8-896f-be2e38df60c5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402867 #edb/ref 1080 "$|A|$ and $|B|$ only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402867 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218